---
// The tick in front of a library the console ships. Sized to sit on a line of body
// text, and `shrink-0` so a two-line entry doesn't squash it.
---

<svg
  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="2.5"
  stroke-linecap="round"
  stroke-linejoin="round"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-accent"
>
  <polyline points="4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6"></polyline>
</svg>
